   "text": "and the belief that a warm word after a cold silence is the truest love you know.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-calm-that-other",
   "t0": 941.721,
   "t1": 948.727,
   "say": 6.49,
   "need": 5.75,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The calm that other people call strength, while your body holds its breath.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-when-someone-finally",
   "t0": 949.367,
   "t1": 957.906,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "And when someone finally asks if it hurt, you hear yourself answer before you can think.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-made-me-who",
   "t0": 958.546,
   "t1": 961.973,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "“It made me who I am.”",
   "v": "Q",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "that-is-why-these",
   "t0": 962.613,
   "t1": 967.063,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "That is why these chains cut so deep.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "they-do-not-feel",
   "t0": 967.703,
   "t1": 973.175,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "They do not feel like chains. They feel like character.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "like-loyalty-like-maturity",
   "t0": 973.815,
   "t1": 977.242,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Like loyalty. Like maturity. Like love.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "but-this-is-also",
   "t0": 977.882,
   "t1": 982.331,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "But this is also where the hope is.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-chains-that-bind",
   "t0": 982.971,
   "t1": 990.488,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The chains that bind us most tightly are the ones built into us earliest,",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "which-means-they-hold",
   "t0": 991.128,
   "t1": 995.577,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "which means they hold the most of us.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "when-one-of-them",
   "t0": 996.217,
   "t1": 1002.712,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "When one of them breaks, we do not just lose a burden.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "we-win-back-everything",
   "t0": 1003.352,
   "t1": 1007.801,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "We win back everything it was holding hostage.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "our-instincts-our-warmth",
   "t0": 1008.441,
   "t1": 1011.151,
   "say": 2.205,
   "need": 2.6,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Our instincts. Our warmth.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "our-ability-to-say",
   "t0": 1011.791,
   "t1": 1016.241,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Our ability to say plainly what is wrong.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-part-of-us",
   "t0": 1016.881,
   "t1": 1022.353,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The part of us that was never broken, only waiting.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-heaviest-chain-once",
   "t0": 1022.993,
   "t1": 1029.487,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The heaviest chain, once seen and broken, gives back the most freedom.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "my-healing-journey-meant",
   "t0": 1030.127,
   "t1": 1039.688,
   "say": 8.871,
   "need": 7.5,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "My healing journey meant forgiving the people who tried to destroy my mind and my heart for money.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "justice-to-me-comes",
   "t0": 1040.328,
   "t1": 1045.8,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Justice, to me, comes from breaking every tool they have,",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "so-that-none-of",
   "t0": 1046.44,
   "t1": 1054.979,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "so that none of them ever works on anyone again by the time I am done.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-comes-from-letting",
   "t0": 1055.619,
   "t1": 1064.67,
   "say": 8.395,
   "need": 7.15,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It comes from letting the truth of who they are be seen by everyone they care about.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "not-by-exposing-them",
   "t0": 1065.31,
   "t1": 1072.826,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Not by exposing them myself, but by exposing their tactics to the entire world,",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "so-they-can-never",
   "t0": 1073.466,
   "t1": 1079.96,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "so they can never again hide in the shadows and feel safe.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-will-take-me",
   "t0": 1080.6,
   "t1": 1085.05,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It will take me a lifetime to finish.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-am-giving-it",
   "t0": 1085.69,
   "t1": 1091.673,
   "say": 5.538,
   "need": 5.05,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "I am giving it away to everyone, wherever this cycle runs.",
   "v": "O",
   "out": 0.56
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-started-with-a",
   "t0": 1092.313,
   "t1": 1095.733,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It started with a question.",
   "v": "F",
   "out": 1.4
  },
  {
   "slug": "now-the-map-is",
   "t0": 1097.213,
   "t1": 1121.0,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Now the map is yours.",
   "v": "F",
   "out": 0.56
  }
